# /etc/default/phone-bootimg on rhodep. Only DTB is read here, by
# phone-kexec-test, to find the kernel package's device tree (its default is
# negroni's). The boot image hook (loader/zz-phone-bootimg) is not used on
# rhodep: its boot images need Motorola's fixups, see docs/rhodep.md. Do not
# copy loader/examples/phone-bootimg.negroni's layout values to this phone.
# Relative to /usr/lib/linux-image-<release>/.
DTB=qcom/sm6375-motorola-rhodep.dtb
